    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"ConfigurePatientGraphsandTrends-PurposeandBenefits\">Purpose and Benefits</h2><p>The Trends Tab allows the user to view Observations for a patient across visits. The observations displayed in this tab can be configured.</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"208c3a21-09b6-4244-9f01-4925fb3d9fab\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>The <em>Trends</em> tab is &quot;just-another-tab&quot; on the Patient Dashboard, with name as <em>Trends</em>. One can name it anything, and use chart related display controls to create this dashboard.</p></div></div><p><br/></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014625/Trends.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1447334514814&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=325\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014625/Trends.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1447334514814&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32604519\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Trends.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014625\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"19\" data-media-id=\"36243ddc-e1dc-416c-8b9b-70ee54c123b4\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014625/Trends.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1447334514814&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1224&amp;height=569 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014625/Trends.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1447334514814&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=325 1x\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Trends Tab</strong></p><h2 id=\"ConfigurePatientGraphsandTrends-Steps\">Steps</h2><h3 id=\"ConfigurePatientGraphsandTrends-1.DisplayTrends/Graphstab\">1. Display Trends/Graphs tab</h3><p>To configure or discard Trends/Graphs tab refer to the configuration snippet below:</p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"478f9073-da13-40fe-8db9-3efff6e16ceb\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader pdl\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>Sample Configuration</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: true; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">&quot;trends&quot;: {\n        &quot;displayByDefault&quot;: true,\n        &quot;maxRecentlyViewedPatients&quot;: 10,\n        &quot;sections&quot;: {\n            &quot;patientInformation&quot;: {\n                &quot;type&quot;: &quot;patientInformation&quot;,\n                &quot;patientAttributes&quot;: [],\n                &quot;addressFields&quot;: [],\n                &quot;displayOrder&quot;: 0,\n                &quot;translationKey&quot;: &quot;DASHBOARD_TITLE_PATIENT_INFORMATION_KEY&quot;\n            }\n}</pre>\n</div></div><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"4fd48fa9-5b62-4f09-8d38-dfb20affd9c9\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><p class=\"title\">Example</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Bhamni/default-config/blob/master/openmrs/apps/clinical/dashboard.json\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Bhamni/default-config/blob/master/openmrs/apps/clinical/dashboard.json</a></p></div></div><p><br/></p><h3 id=\"ConfigurePatientGraphsandTrends-2.AddObservationstoTrendsTab\">2. Add Observations to Trends Tab</h3><p>To configure Observations to be displayed in the tab refer to the configuration snippet below:</p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"6a0ba3eb-d552-4046-a615-f4a2ccba88d4\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader pdl\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>Sample Configuration</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: true; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">   &quot;weight/BMI&quot;: {\n                &quot;type&quot;: &quot;observationGraph&quot;,\n                &quot;config&quot;: {\n                    &quot;yAxisConcepts&quot;: [\n                        &quot;Body mass index&quot;\n                    ],\n                    &quot;xAxisConcept&quot;: &quot;observationDateTime&quot;,\n                    &quot;numberOfVisits&quot;: 10\n                },\n                &quot;displayOrder&quot;: 6,\n                &quot;title&quot;: &quot;BMI&quot;\n            },\n            &quot;Lab, Hemoglobin test result&quot;: {\n                &quot;type&quot;: &quot;observationGraph&quot;,\n                &quot;config&quot;: {\n                    &quot;yAxisConcepts&quot;: [\n                        &quot;lab, Hemoglobin test result&quot;\n                    ],\n                    &quot;xAxisConcept&quot;: &quot;observationDateTime&quot;,\n                    &quot;numberOfVisits&quot;: 10\n                },\n                &quot;displayOrder&quot;: 6,\n                &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Hemoglobin&quot;\n            },\n            &quot;AST&quot;: {\n                &quot;type&quot;: &quot;observationGraph&quot;,\n                &quot;config&quot;: {\n                    &quot;yAxisConcepts&quot;: [\n                        &quot;Lab, AST&quot;\n                    ],\n                    &quot;xAxisConcept&quot;: &quot;observationDateTime&quot;,\n                    &quot;numberOfVisits&quot;: 10\n                },\n                &quot;displayOrder&quot;: 8,\n                &quot;title&quot;: &quot;AST&quot;\n            }\n        },\n        &quot;translationKey&quot;: &quot;DASHBOARD_TAB_TRENDS_KEY&quot;\n    }\n}</pre>\n</div></div><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"64e9464e-ac5e-40ac-98d8-81a08975506c\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">Example</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Bhamni/default-config/blob/master/openmrs/apps/clinical/dashboard.json\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Bhamni/default-config/blob/master/openmrs/apps/clinical/dashboard.json</a></p></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro has-no-icon confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e7b3588e-96e1-4de3-a29d-46427cf35a1e\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"1eef5f60-d9fa-4d67-bdce-574372004a61\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"f5e76242-9ad1-477e-9fa2-70ff0a12c473\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Feature Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32014350/Clinical\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32014350\" data-linked-resource-version=\"9\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Clinical Services - Feature Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"b94e3ad7-5c3a-4de1-9e38-0d0d4195b78d\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Usage Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32604195/Clinical+Services\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32604195\" data-linked-resource-version=\"48\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Clinical Services - User Guide</a></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"1e4c02a5-7279-4edb-ada2-45a3fec352fa\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #1FA5A0;color: White;\"><b>Related Links</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/37945573/Display+Controls#DisplayControls-GraphControl\" data-linked-resource-id=\"37945573\" data-linked-resource-version=\"155\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Observation Graph Control</a></p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
